  "caption": "Quinn met a reformer for the first time and wondered if it was a very fancy bed. A thousand online videos later, Quinn was more confused (and a bit tangled).\n\nClinical Pilates is Pilates delivered as part of physio care. The difference isn't the equipment, it's the process: an assessment first, then a program built for you that progresses as you get stronger.\n\nGood to know: mat work counts too, consistency matters more than intensity, and many people notice changes within about 6–8 sessions. Pilates and other well-designed exercise can both work, so pick what you'll stick with.\n\nCheck in first if you have significant pain, recent surgery, pregnancy, osteoporosis or a condition that needs exercise changes.\n\nOur Sydney CBD and Chatswood physios can help. Book via the link in bio.\n\nGeneral information only — not a substitute for an individual assessment.",
